Version: 1.14.0-1.resolute1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: WonderSkydive <WonderSkydive@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6 (>= 12), libqt5core5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5gui5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5network5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5widgets5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5svg5, libqt5x11extras5, libqt5dbus5t64, qtwayland5, libx11-6
Suggests: thunderbird
Homepage: https://github.com/WonderSkydive/birdtray
Description: Birdtray — Thunderbird unread mail and window controls
 Displays unread mail from selected Thunderbird folders in the system tray.
 Supports X11 and KDE Plasma Wayland on Ubuntu 26.04 amd64.
 Community edition maintained by WonderSkydive.
